WHAT THIS LICENSE COVERS
========================

The MIT terms below apply to the SOURCE CODE of TrainerKit and nothing else.

They do NOT apply to the game data this project reads or redistributes:

  · `apps/web/public/dataset/gamedata.json` and everything derived from it.
    It is built from Pokemon GO's GAME_MASTER, obtained through
    github.com/alexelgt/game_masters, whose own notice reads: "This repo is
    for educational use only. All content found within this repo is the
    property of The Pokemon Company and Niantic."
  · species names, move names, artwork, and any other material owned by
    Nintendo, The Pokemon Company, Creatures Inc., Game Freak, or Scopely
    Explore (formerly Niantic).
  · event and egg data read at runtime from Leek Duck via ScrapedDuck.

None of that is ours to license, and this file does not attempt to license
it. Granting rights over someone else's work is not something a permissive
licence can do, and claiming to is worse than saying nothing: it invites
people to rely on a permission that was never anyone's to give.

TrainerKit is an independent, free, fan-made tool. It is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or sponsored by any of the companies named above, it requires no
game account, and it never communicates with the game's servers. Trademarks
belong to their respective owners.

