NOTE ON GAME DATA

This license covers the SOURCE CODE of TrainerKit only.

It does not and cannot grant any right over Pokémon or Pokémon GO data,
names, or artwork, which belong to their respective owners. This repository
contains no game artwork and no raw game data; see DATA.md for the provenance
of everything the build pipeline touches.
